": "if R is available then"}, {"y0": 0.2551945174676328, "y1": 0.2709682733214591, "x0": 0.29868915601147605, "x1": 0.3780025717301526, "t": "Acquire R"}, {"y0": 0.2715151513008274, "y1": 0.28197674411957885, "x0": 0.300751880922455, "x1": 0.40789473294032697, "t": "Release lock L"}, {"y0": 0.30363636369825475, "y1": 0.3154069768195187, "x0": 0.2988721851763502, "x1": 0.6033834437710186, "t": "if R is owned by another process P then"}, {"y0": 0.31976744223948517, "y1": 0.3328488367818325, "x0": 0.3251879677242985, "x1": 0.7161654027017671, "t": "Terminate P, after releasing all resources owned by P"}, {"y0": 0.33575581424521406, "y1": 0.350303030487224, "x0": 0.32518797096200863, "x1": 0.4022556361338561, "t": "Acquire R"}, {"y0": 0.3516618587018534, "y1": 0.3620009321141995, "x0": 0.3270482111443326, "x1": 0.39851569743916565, "t": "Restart P"}, {"y0": 0.36599130157351634, "y1": 0.38110172203176085, "x0": 0.32512504235896406, "x1": 0.4342734565163651, "t": "Release lock L"}, {"y0": 0.38363636367816767, "y1": 0.395348837345197, "x0": 0.2969924804306863, "x1": 0.3533834580091634, "t": "end if"}, {"y0": 0.39970930260164605, "y1": 0.4127906971439934, "x0": 0.2706766918538554, "x1": 0.33458646763862593, "t": "end if"}, {"y0": 0.41424418628623916, "y1": 0.4273255808285864, "x0": 0.2500000017871166, "x1": 0.35714285380498867, "t": "end function"}, {"y0": 0.4476744185123285, "y1": 0.4636627903902878, "x0": 0.23308271324308008, "x1": 0.7631578821516567, "t": "Which of the following choice(s) about the above scheme is/are correct?"}, {"y0": 0.4956395353207954, "y1": 0.5101744185309487, "x0": 0.18984962495104785, "x1": 0.21992481179707243, "t": "(A)"}, {"y0": 0.49563953531119065, "y1": 0.5087209298535379, "x0": 0.23120300266446997, "x1": 0.603383451094929, "t": "The scheme ensures that deadlocks will not occur."}, {"y0": 0.5436046512728303, "y1": 0.5581395344829836, "x0": 0.18984962454691254, "x1": 0.2199248113929371, "t": "(B)"}, {"y0": 0.5436046515902605, "y1": 0.5569696971955442, "x0": 0.22932331327096322, "x1": 0.484962392493448, "t": "The scheme may lead to live-lock."}, {"y0": 0.5901162790440629, "y1": 0.6061046509220223, "x0": 0.1898496236133312, "x1": 0.22180451150571645, "t": "(C)"}, {"y0": 0.5915151517658129, "y1": 0.6048484850991462, "x0": 0.23308271572084818, "x1": 0.4962405991287757, "t": "The scheme may lead to starvation."}, {"y0": 0.6393939396547947, "y1": 0.6540697672591463, "x0": 0.18796993155009048, "x1": 0.6127819375288571, "t": "(D) | The scheme violates the mutual exclusion property."}, {"y0": 0.9460606063217823, "y1": 0.9593939396551157, "x0": 0.15601504361527774, "x1": 0.398496239429835, "t": "CS, Set-2 - Copyright \u00a9 GATE 2021"}, {"y0": 0.9460013297104289, "y1": 0.9595219265325319, "x0": 0.7537091099949309, "x1": 0.8477946478964237, "t": "Page 35 of 43"}]